ur of wind through the eaves, and a soft, calm traditional guqin melody underlining the scene, all rendered in a gentle, understated volume. The overall image reads as a single key frame from a period drama, with clean natural color grading, coherent single-source warm daylight, and no other people present.\"}"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 778, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "输入任何"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "size": [490.7386474609375, 625.919921875], "pos": [885.525634765625, 3295.62939453125], "id": 501, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 23, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "{\"Style: cinematic-realistic live-action film still. In a medium shot, Su Ziyang stands at the entrance of a Daoist medicine hall, facing the main gate and gazing out, while Li Xianzi steps out from within the doorway to welcome him. Su Ziyang is a young man in his late twenties with short black hair, wearing a plain dark-blue cloth robe with a light-gray inner collar, his posture upright yet relaxed, head turned toward the gate, eyes carrying a faint trace of anticipation. Li Xianzi is a young woman with long black hair loosely tied back, wearing a pale-green ruqun with a white outer shawl draped over her shoulders, one hand lightly lifting the edge of her shawl as she walks forward, her expression warm and welcoming, a gentle smile on her face. The setting is the entrance of a traditional Daoist medicine hall: above the wooden lattice door hangs a vertical wooden plaque inscribed with the three characters 'Daoist Medicine Hall' in regular script, the door frames are dark-brown timber with worn paint, beside t